#. Theme Name of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "Music Star Amplify"
msgstr "Music Star Amplify"

#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "Music Star Amplify is a child theme of Music Star for bands, DJs, labels and music blogs. Its Live Visualizer reacts to the real music: when a visitor plays an audio file on the site, animated bars or a wave under the header move with the frequencies of the song. Stage Lights adds a spotlight that follows the mouse over the header image. Release Countdown shows a live countdown to a new album or event, and the News Ticker scrolls the latest posts. The Raleway font is hosted locally. All options are in the Customizer under \"Amplify Options\"."
msgstr ""

